; Root hints for the fake fixture root.
;
; @ROOT_ADDRESS@ is substituted by entrypoint.sh (default 127.0.0.2, the
; dns-root container). Unbound needs an address here, never a container
; hostname — Docker's embedded resolver at 127.0.0.11 would otherwise sit in
; the path, which is precisely the interference this topology avoids.
.                        3600000  NS    ns0.test.
ns0.test.                3600000  A     @ROOT_ADDRESS@
